      <title>Newly released records reveal 725% increase in Medicaid for Illinois children without SSNs</title>
      <link>https://justthenews.com/nation/states/center-square/watch-foia-reveals-725-increase-medicaid-il-children-without-ssns?utm_source=justthenews.com&amp;utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_campaign=external-news-aggregators</link>
      <description>After more than a year of digging, Statehouse candidate Bailey Templeton’s most public records collection shows 1,085 Illinois children under 18 without SSNs had Medicaid bills of $66 million in 2025. That’s up 725% from $8 million for 450 children in 2021.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://justthenews.com/nation/states/center-square/watch-foia-reveals-725-increase-medicaid-il-children-without-ssns?utm_source=justthenews.com&amp;utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_campaign=external-news-aggregators</guid>
